        "Beyond transit delays, shipping costs play a major role in customer friction. When shipping fees make up a disproportionate share of total order cost, buyer expectations rise, amplifying frustration if deliveries arrive late.\n",
        "\n",
        "Here, we evaluate the freight burden across different basket price tiers to determine whether high relative shipping costs exacerbate rating decay or primarily create purchase-level resistance."
