        "### **Practical Recommendations**\n",
        "1. **Recalibrate SLAs for outer regions:** Pad promised delivery dates on long-haul routes into the Northeast and North, especially the Northeast, where the late rate is about double that of the other regions.\n",
        "2. **Prioritize 7+ day delay interventions:** Severe delays tie up nearly half of all at-risk GMV and come with the worst reviews; automated tracking alerts should flag stalled parcels before they reach the 4-day mark.\n",
